{"alias":"/schoolsupports/communityschools","title":"Community Schools","changed":"2026-04-06T22:49:45+00:00","before":"<img alt=\"Community Schools Banner\" data-align=\"center\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a6a5ba0e-41f9-4130-90ea-0e681124649a\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Community.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 461px;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><iframe align=\"left\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9hmmfBku3Hs?si=GabhQDHcK3MRek1e\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 523px;\">The Community Schools Team provides support, guidance, and resources to schools across Maine looking to advance community school strategies to improve student outcomes. The Community Schools initiative is grounded in the vision and mission of the Maine Department of Education by providing learning environments that are trusted centers of the community and help all Maine students reach their full potential and leave school prepared for work, life, and post-secondary education opportunities. Community Schools are committed to forming strong partnerships with families and organizations to provide well-rounded educational opportunities and wrap-around support to meet the whole child's needs.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-left\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"teacher reading to children\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Untitled%20design%20%283%29_1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Maine DOE Resources</h5>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-presentationml-presentation file--x-office-presentation\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a3b79630-369f-4ba8-93be-5fa43fe7f9b9\" filename=\"Community Schools Presentation for website.pptx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Community%20Schools%20Presentation%20for%20website.pptx\">Community Schools Presentation Overview [Powerpoint]</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYIXcgeRqv0\">Community Schools Information Session [YouTube]</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\"><br />\r\nResources for Community Schools</h5>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.communityschools.org%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMatthew.G.Leavitt%40maine.gov%7Cf5265dd87c014e9c73e808dc2e5766f2%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C638436200121979286%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=TIAR5H1IC6YslMOIVJJ%2FuycGQYz1znDWcJ5xvanZgas%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Coalition for Community Schools</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nccs.org%2Fpublications%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMatthew.G.Leavitt%40maine.gov%7Cf5265dd87c014e9c73e808dc2e5766f2%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C638436200121984553%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=zU0TEizjQ6h98HXQHw2rmi5tYy%2FCYc1yPy%2Fj0RjHOS4%3D&amp;reserved=0\">National Center for Community School Resources</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearningpolicyinstitute.org%2Fproject%2Fcommunity-schools-forward&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMatthew.G.Leavitt%40maine.gov%7Cf5265dd87c014e9c73e808dc2e5766f2%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C638436200121989803%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Wq5DwuwMT87innKDElQmg6lMjIyfR2pqHF5SGi%2BUsI4%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Learning Policy Institute</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearningpolicyinstitute.org%2Fproduct%2Fcommunity-schools-playbook&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMatthew.G.Leavitt%40maine.gov%7Cf5265dd87c014e9c73e808dc2e5766f2%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C638436200121995497%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=v3kWg%2FuoYu6cV0TYKfY4%2FZaJaGtv85HdGnE0ID3Ene0%3D&amp;reserved=0\">LPI - Community Schools Playbook</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nea.org%2Fbuild-community-schools&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMatthew.G.Leavitt%40maine.gov%7Cf5265dd87c014e9c73e808dc2e5766f2%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C638436200122001349%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=h96T0%2B1H9z2SiTfHHV7plRwipJTU6XZmtcJQieQtEII%3D&amp;reserved=0\">NEA - 5 Steps to Kickstarting Community Schools in Your District</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"person at computer\" data-entity-type=\"file\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/pexels-yan-krukau-8613089_0.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>According to the Coalition for Community Schools: \"Community schools strategy transforms a school into a place where educators, local community members, families, and students work together to strengthen conditions for student learning and healthy development. As partners, they organize in- and out-of-school resources, supports, and opportunities so that young people thrive.\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a data-auth=\"Verified\" data-linkindex=\"1\" href=\"https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.communityschools.org%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMatthew.G.Leavitt%40maine.gov%7Cf5265dd87c014e9c73e808dc2e5766f2%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C638436200121903150%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=KdszeNjbdQGGp9Z2gWt327e2NZMiyx8Jz0SP3LxSODw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Original URL: https://www.communityschools.org/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\">https://www.communityschools.org/</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\" id=\"contact\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube__person\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start;\">\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube__contact\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\r\n<p><strong>Ann Hanna</strong><br />\r\n<em>Community School Specialist (Consultant)</em><br />\r\n<strong>Phone</strong>: 207-446-8127<br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Ann.C.Hanna@maine.gov\">Ann.C.Hanna@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube__supports\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\r\n<p><strong>Supports the following areas:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>The Community School model.</li>\r\n\t<li>Guidance and support for existing or new community schools.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Office of School & Student Supports</p>\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><div class=\"doe-video\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9hmmfBku3Hs?si=GabhQDHcK3MRek1e\" title=\"YouTube video player\"></iframe></div></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>The Community Schools Team provides support, guidance, and resources to schools across Maine looking to advance community school strategies to improve student outcomes. The Community Schools initiative is grounded in the vision and mission of the Maine Department of Education by providing learning environments that are trusted centers of the community and help all Maine students reach their full potential and leave school prepared for work, life, and post-secondary education opportunities. Community Schools are committed to forming strong partnerships with families and organizations to provide well-rounded educational opportunities and wrap-around support to meet the whole child's needs.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-left\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"teacher reading to children\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Untitled%20design%20%283%29_1.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Maine DOE Resources</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Community%20Schools%20Presentation%20for%20website.pptx\" aria-label=\"Community Schools Presentation Overview, PowerPoint\">Community Schools Presentation Overview</a><span class=\"doe-chip\">PowerPoint</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYIXcgeRqv0\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Community Schools Information Session, Video\">Community Schools Information Session</a><span class=\"doe-chip\">Video</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Resources for Community Schools</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.communityschools.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Coalition for Community Schools</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.nccs.org/publications/\" target=\"_blank\">National Center for Community School Resources</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://learningpolicyinstitute.org/project/community-schools-forward\" target=\"_blank\">Learning Policy Institute</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://learningpolicyinstitute.org/product/community-schools-playbook\" target=\"_blank\">LPI - Community Schools Playbook</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.nea.org/build-community-schools\" target=\"_blank\">NEA - 5 Steps to Kickstarting Community Schools in Your District</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"person at computer\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/pexels-yan-krukau-8613089_0.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>According to the Coalition for Community Schools: \"Community schools strategy transforms a school into a place where educators, local community members, families, and students work together to strengthen conditions for student learning and healthy development. As partners, they organize in- and out-of-school resources, supports, and opportunities so that young people thrive.\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"doe-action\"><a data-auth=\"Verified\" data-linkindex=\"1\" href=\"https://www.communityschools.org/\" title=\"Original URL: https://www.communityschools.org/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg\">https://www.communityschools.org/</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\" id=\"contact\">\r\n<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube__person\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: flex-start;\">\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube__contact\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\r\n<p><strong>Ann Hanna</strong><br />\r\n<em>Community School Specialist (Consultant)</em><br />\r\n<strong>Phone</strong>: 207-446-8127<br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Ann.C.Hanna@maine.gov\">Ann.c.Hanna@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube__supports\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\r\n<p><strong>Supports the following areas:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>The Community School model.</li>\r\n\t<li>Guidance and support for existing or new community schools.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"emailcase","on":true,"label":"Write the email addresses the same way","why":"1 address is shown in whatever case it was typed in. The house form capitalises each name and leaves a middle initial in lower case — Ann.C.Hanna@maine.gov → Ann.c.Hanna@maine.gov. Only the first letter of each part changes, so a name that spells itself LaBreck keeps doing so.","value":"1 address"},{"id":"cardtitles","on":true,"label":"Put the card titles on one level","why":"2 card titles are written at a level copied from an example rather than chosen — h5 on a page whose sections are h2. Only the number changes.","value":"2 titles"},{"id":"actionbtn","on":true,"label":"Draw a closing link as the action it is","why":"1 passage ends with a paragraph holding nothing but a link — the thing the passage was leading up to. Set as running text it looks like any other link in the sentence above it. The site already has one way of drawing an action, so it takes that. The words do not change.","value":"1 link"},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"Community.png"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Office of School & Student Supports\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /schoolsupports."}],"mechanical":["safelinks unwrapped: 6","empty paragraphs removed: 4","image alignment translated to the house class: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 7","target set by destination: 7","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 1","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 2","tables normalised to the house shape: 1","table cells released from fixed pixel widths: 2","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","video wrapped: 1","action links marked: 8","format labels chipped: 2","format chip moved out of the link: 2"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/schoolsupports/communityschools","title":"Community Schools","changed":"2026-04-06T22:49:45+00:00","words":225,"bytes":7261,"fixes":["safelinks unwrapped: 6","empty paragraphs removed: 4","image alignment translated to the house class: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 7","target set by destination: 7","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 1","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 2","tables normalised to the house shape: 1","table cells released from fixed pixel widths: 2","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","video wrapped: 1","action links marked: 8","format labels chipped: 2","format chip moved out of the link: 2"],"flags":["no section-header device","h5 card titles","inline style= remains"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":5,"t":"Maine DOE Resources","bh":false},{"l":5,"t":"Resources for Community Schools","bh":false},{"l":3,"t":"Contact","bh":false}],"outline":[{"i":0,"issue":"jumps h1 to h5","text":"Maine DOE Resources"}],"components":{"cards":6,"cardHeaders":0,"card